        <body>
            <div xml:id="d793">

                <pb facs="0899" n="803" xml:id="pg803"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October 24,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Government turned over to Castro by acting Vice-President. Castro seems very
                    popular, but his cabinet viewed with suspicion.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
